2. **Resolution of Ambiguous References**:  
   - When films have similar titles or variations in spelling or date-related differences, verify the correct film by matching the exact title and year.  
   - When multiple persons involved share similar names, use associated facts (birthdates, awards, nationalities) to disambiguate.  

