- Locate their birthdates or film release years from the paragraphs.  
- Compare these dates if needed, stating explicitly which date belongs to whom.  
- Identify any awards mentioned with proper context if the question asks about accolades.  
- Summarize all findings succinctly, justifying your conclusion by key dates or details found.  
